# Frontend environment variables
#
# With Amplify Gen 2, all backend config is read from amplify_outputs.json
# (generated by `npx ampx sandbox` or `npx ampx generate outputs`).
# No manual VITE_ environment variables are needed for Amplify resources.
#
# The only variable that may be needed is for the Amplify App ID
# if you are running pipeline deploys locally:
# AMPLIFY_APP_ID=<your-amplify-app-id>
